{"id":1189,"root":"قطف","bw":"qTf","tr":"q-ṭ-f","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِطْفٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> A <em>bunch</em> of grapes, &amp;c.: pl. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُطُوفٌ</span>: see an ex. voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذَلَّلَ</span>. ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِطْفٌ</span> <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقْطُوفٌ</span>. (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بسط</span>.) See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَسِيطٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطَفٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَقْلٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطَافٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِطَافٌ</span> The <em>time of gathering the crop of grapes:</em> (S, Mgh, K:) or the latter has this meaning; and the former is allowable accord. to Ks: (T, TA:) and the latter is also an inf. n., (Mgh,) or may be so, (Ks, T, TA,) meaning the <em>gathering of the crop of grapes:</em> (Mgh:) [or both have this meaning; for] you say, <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هٰذَا زَمَانُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القَطَافِ</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القِطَافِ</span>. (Msb.) See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَدَادٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطِيفٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> a coll. gen. n. syn. with <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطَايءِفُ</span>, mentioned in the TA voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُبْلُوجٌ</span>, which see. ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطِيفَةٌ</span> <em>A villous,</em> or <em>nappy,</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دِثَار</span> [or <em>outer wrapping garment</em>]. (S, Msb, K.) See also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راَحُولَاتٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَطَايءِفُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see my 1001 Nights, note 23 to chap. viii. See also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زَلاَبِيَه</span>. In the TA, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كنف</span>, it is applied to <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُنَافَة</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِقْطَفٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> (<em>vulg.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقْطَفٌ</span>) [pl. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقَاطِف</span>] A handbasket, made of palm-leaves: <em>so called because originally used in gathering fruit.</em> (See also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُفَّة</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زَنْبِيل</span>.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":1874,"entries":7,"shownEntries":7,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"qTf"}